    - paragraph: This legacy planner fixes a 32 × 32 canvas and proposes 60 frames. That is not an approved detail target. Review native detail and yard size above before using this proposal. Frame counts and timing still need art and biological review. Without supplied references, the source stage searches Wikimedia Commons using the public scientific name. Candidate metadata stays private and requires rights, species and pose review. This does not download images, call a model or select artwork for a bird.
